  triage:title "No integration test for nudge/hook failure surfacing as warning-only after successful array receive" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr report: no integration test proving an injected nudge/hook/notification failure on a peer array follows a successful receive and surfaces only as a warning (not a failure of the receive itself). Sprint AK.8 deliverable #4 explicitly requires: 'Explicitly prove that nudge/hook/notification failures are retained as warnings and do not turn an already committed peer receive into an error response.' Tests exist for singleton writes (tests_post_send_graft_warning.rs) but not for peer message arrays." ;
